#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""SafeVoice update 2: HDS mapping with shape validation, coordinate rounding, database encryption.

Run from the repository root (after apply_safevoice_changes.py has been applied):
    python apply_safevoice_changes_2.py --check     preview
    python apply_safevoice_changes_2.py             apply

Keeps each file's own line endings and other people's edits; edits by exact text. If a file does not
match what it expects, NOTHING is written and the file is named. Safe to run twice.
Then:  pip install pyshacl cryptography   and restart Streamlit.
"""
